---js
const eleventyNavigation = {
	key: "Home",
	order: 1
};

const numberOfLatestPostsToShow = 3;
---

<p>
Hi! I am Anshul Chauhan. Welcome to my personal corner of the web.
</p>

<p>
Some of my interests outside of programming are: playing <a
href="https://x.com/anshulxyz/status/1865803780635447451"
target="_blank">football</a>, and playing <a href="{{ '/go-game' | url
}}">Go</a>.
</p>

{% set publishedPosts = collections.publishedPosts %}
{% set postsCount = publishedPosts | length %}
{% set latestPostsCount = postsCount | min(numberOfLatestPostsToShow) %}
<h1>Latest {{ latestPostsCount }} Post{% if latestPostsCount != 1 %}s{% endif %}</h1>

{% set postslist = publishedPosts | head(-1 * numberOfLatestPostsToShow) %}
{% set postslistCounter = postsCount %}
{% include "postslist.njk" %}

{% set morePosts = postsCount - numberOfLatestPostsToShow %}
{% if morePosts > 0 %}
<p>{{ morePosts }} more post{% if morePosts != 1 %}s{% endif %} can be found in <a href="blog.njk">the archive</a>.</p>
{% endif %}

